('CDS credit curve','Cần dữ liệu','','','Bootstrap risk-neutral survival/hazard từ CDS term quotes.','Reference entity quotes/tenors, recovery, discount curve và CDS conventions.','Price premium/protection legs theo accrual conventions; solve hazard từng tenor; reprice quotes bằng independent pricer.','Credit curve, implied spreads và pricing residuals.','Index OAS không thay CDS quotes; risk-neutral probability không thay borrower real-world PD.','Lấy licensed term quotes và freeze pricing conventions/benchmark.'),
